    <detaileddescription>
<para>Raw device pointer + size + device for wrapping in-process (e.g. as a torch tensor via <bold>cuda_array_interface</bold> / DLPack). Does NOT create an IPC handle. The device_ptr is read-only from the SDK&apos;s side; external code that maps it may still write the memory. </para>
